=== HINT 1 ===
Process32First(snap, &pe) returns TRUE if there is at least one process.
Then loop: while (Process32Next(snap, &pe)) { ... }

=== HINT 2 ===
PROCESSENTRY32 must have dwSize set BEFORE the first call:
  pe.dwSize = sizeof(pe);

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
if (Process32First(snap, &pe)) {
    do {
        printf("%-8lu %-8lu %-8lu %s\n",
               pe.th32ProcessID,
               pe.th32ParentProcessID,
               pe.cntThreads,
               pe.szExeFile);
    } while (Process32Next(snap, &pe));
}
